### 1.8.3 柯里化

1.定义:只传递给函数一部分参数来调用它，让它返回一个函数去处理剩下的参数

```js
fn(a,b,c,d)=>fn(a)(b)(c)(d)
```

2.代码实现:

```js
  const currying = fn => {
  const len = fn.length
  return function curr (...args1) {
      if (args1.length >= len) {
          return fn(...args1)
      }
      return (...args2) => curr(...args1, ...args2)
      }
  }
```

